{"symbol":"INFINITY","yahoo":"INFINITY.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Infinity Infoway Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","website":"https://infinityinfoway.com","about":"Infinity Infoway Limited, a Software as a Service company, provides integrated online ERP software for manufacturing, education, retail, construction, supply chain and customer relationship management, sales force, and other industries in India and internationally. Its education enterprise resource planning (ERP) products include Online Exam Software, which is designed to streamline exam management and enhance the assessment experience for educational institutions and organizations; Online Question Paper Delivery, a system used by schools, colleges, and universities to administer exams and distribute question papers to students, as well as to create question papers, schedule exams, deliver question papers, monitor exams, and manage results; and Brainzorg, a digital learning platform that provides an opportunity for students who wish to get extra help to learn and earn knowledge regarding their current education standard. The company also provides industrial ERP solutions comprising dealer, procurement, inventory, marketing, logistics, sales, order, production, store, and bank management solutions, as well as RoC, HR and payroll system, taxation and audit, import/export, customer care, account and finance, and online bank reconciliation solutions. Infinity Infoway Limited was incorporated in 2008 and is headquartered in Rajkot, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:30:27+00:00","quote":{"price":540.0,"prevClose":545.0,"marketCap":294.46,"high52":559.0,"low52":294.0,"pe":36.83,"bookValue":76.76,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":null,"shares":0.5453,"insiders":83.61,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-10-08","2025-10-09","2025-10-10","2025-10-13","2025-10-14","2025-10-15","2025-10-16","2025-10-17","2025-10-20","2025-10-21","2025-10-23","2025-10-24","2025-10-27","2025-10-